{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "486ea0ec74ab455d3b0fae79a0428d78f641b7b5d7c21de735cfa3e58acbee3b", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。茜と一緒に街へ出かけた。\n日が沈むと、やっぱりまだ少し冷えるな……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。和茜一起出门逛了逛。\n太阳落山后，果然还是有点冷啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "1600b718d99b105687881a0cf226218d6fad39bd3000ab246341ff769490eed7", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん♪\nそろそろ上着返すね。はいっ、ありがと！", "zh": "{$P$}♪\n外套差不多该还给你啦。拿去，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ab28f9fc4f7fb23c638a8d6410c1bdca0bef167d5a37f091b4c400655a2aae0f", "ja": "どういたしまして。けど、大丈夫か？\n寒いなら、まだ着てても……。", "zh": "不客气。不过，没事吗？\n要是冷的话，还可以再穿一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "06997f36cbbede6b07891729e2b0c91830e61de604c53ba4d802c33f03ad95d9", "ja": "ううん、平気だよ。\n歩いてたら、体も温まってきたし！　それに……。", "zh": "不用啦，我没事哦。\n走着走着身体也暖和起来了！而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc31ac300c269f2516bf4d7e09400856264e5f698e4c773b14a050d854ab8017", "ja": "上着を羽織ってたら、カワイイ茜ちゃんが見られなくて\n{$P$}ちゃん悲しいでしょ？", "zh": "要是披着外套，就看不到可爱的小茜了，{$P$}会伤心的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2832af02d6bd57cc6aa7f4a0f07bac42f459bbcefd226354da86ae6d14383bee", "ja": "はは、そうだな。気遣ってくれてありがとう。\n……さてと、それじゃ帰ろうか。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。谢谢你的关心。\n……好了，那我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "39543be75c4f329139d6aceaeaa7df43b266fd1d12eb4bcbfd0d3158b75fd7ba", "ja": "えっ？　……ええーっ！　もう帰るの！？\n夜はまだまだこれからなんだよ！？", "zh": "咦？……诶——！这就要回去了吗！？\n夜晚才刚刚开始呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ac488b3637432037711ee712718ad92e19ecc2fbf1c2f499fea236773bc610a7", "ja": "何言ってんだ。茜は高校生だろ？\n遅くなると、親御さんも心配するしな。", "zh": "说什么呢。茜还是高中生吧？\n回去晚了，父母也会担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "69ba0e4d0fbfb5090034ae1e11338e85a8657a7fe34cacd207127a5e4868664b", "ja": "ん、ん～、そうなんだけどさ……。茜ちゃん的には、\n全然甘やかされポイントが足りてないっていうか……。", "zh": "唔，嗯～，虽然是那样啦……。但对小茜来说，\n该说完全没有被宠够点数呢，还是说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1009_p", "source_sha256": "535266ef611aa4687554fe11d74e0a254b96a40c0d41a0ea1a0fdab4e0411cd2", "ja": "甘やかされポイント……？", "zh": "被宠溺点数……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "efea0866c6b565c73befbbe9667c526f30485da887be40da2d24eb72b58fc630", "ja": "あれ、知らない？　茜ちゃんをどれだけ甘やかしたかの\nポイントだよ？　ひとつ甘やかしたら、1ポイント♪", "zh": "咦，不知道吗？这是把小茜宠了多少次的积分哦？\n每宠一次，就有1分♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "da89b9ae39b5d0040cca4f18e69beb6fb99a2456999af455fb35f8334ff5a8b3", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、最近忙しくて、\n茜ちゃんのこと全然かまってくれなかったでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}最近太忙了，\n都没怎么理小茜对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "904a1e9b4dd1fc463e315106c26cb5c8aff709ba526700fcd1719caaf679a1ec", "ja": "だから今日は、いっぱい甘やかしてもらおうかなって！\nでも……全然ポイントが足りませんっ！", "zh": "所以今天，就让你尽情宠宠茜吧！\n不过……点数完全不够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e49a063a9e70ac0fa24945d6db4823d0f77dfd98ff72447dcf227cf136871696", "ja": "ポイント制は初耳だな……。でもたしかに……\n茜とゆっくり話をしたのは久々だったな。", "zh": "积分制我还是第一次听说……不过确实……\n已经很久没和茜悠闲地聊过天了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9ca8dcdd67a455a12060bff641eeedec2a55a39f9ccdff7bd2304e44044d4493", "ja": "ポイント稼ぎってわけじゃないけど、\n帰ってから電話するっていうのは、どうだ？", "zh": "虽然不是为了赚取积分，\n但回去之后打个电话，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "9209878170389d53bce7fd4fbab91b9aac0bf275b92af98fb378f2f8f5be3350", "ja": "えっ、いいの？　ホントに！？", "zh": "诶，可以吗？真的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1016_p", "source_sha256": "164eb9a93d615b01017093b901ccf5ae3e94b872efd0ff98e830409db3705fd7", "ja": "ああ。茜を理解するには、もっと話さないとって\n思ってたんだ。電話なら、家からでも出来るだろ？", "zh": "嗯。要了解茜，就得多聊聊才行。我一直这么想着。打电话的话，在家里也能聊吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "689599e2deb1ed9212e80a9043872e20d56a4f4d5685976e60becfee6f0e6f85", "ja": "……{$P$}ちゃん。\nそっか～。茜ちゃんのこと……えへ、えへへへへ～♪", "zh": "……{$P$}呀。\n原来如此～。关于小茜的事……诶嘿、诶嘿嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "31c0580ff8a77ba324ab18085e02945d4b33ee1ff446e7516f038d1e8667a4b5", "ja": "それじゃあ、ダッシュで帰ろっか！\n家に着いたら、すぐ電話するから絶対に出てね♪", "zh": "那我们就冲刺回去吧！\n到了家我会马上打电话，你一定要接哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0384_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "eeb7d74c931945a93af1b3552d0734bde99b9b74aaf08684855f44b4b7d5babb", "ja": "今夜は茜ちゃんが満足するまで付き合ってもらうから、\n甘やかす準備よろしくね♪", "zh": "今晚要陪我到小茜满意为止，所以做好宠我的准备吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
